{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":22,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["論耶路撒冷的信息"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["論異象谷的默示：",{"text":"有甚麼事使你這滿城的人都上房頂呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你這滿處吶喊、大有喧嘩的城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歡樂的邑啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你中間被殺的並不是被刀殺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不是因打仗死亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你所有的官長一同逃跑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都為弓箭手所捆綁。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你中間一切被找到的都一同被捆綁；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們本是逃往遠方的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我說：你們轉眼不看我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要痛哭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要因我眾民","poem":1},{"noteId":17},{"text":"的毀滅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就竭力安慰我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為主－萬軍之耶和華使「異象谷」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有潰亂、踐踏、煩擾的日子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城被攻破，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哀聲達到山間。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以攔帶着箭袋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"還有坐戰車的和馬兵；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吉珥揭開盾牌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你嘉美的谷遍滿戰車，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也有馬兵在城門前排列。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他去掉猶大的遮蓋。","poem":1},"那日，你就仰望林庫內的軍器。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["你們看見大衛城的破口很多，便聚積下池的水，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["又數點耶路撒冷的房屋，將房屋拆毀，修補城牆，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["又在兩道城牆中間挖一個聚水池可盛舊池的水，卻不仰望做這事的主，也不顧念從古定這事的。"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"當那日，主－萬軍之耶和華叫人哭泣哀號，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"頭上光禿，身披麻布。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰知，人倒歡喜快樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宰牛殺羊，吃肉喝酒，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們吃喝吧！因為明天要死了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華親自默示我說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這罪孽直到你們死，斷不得赦免！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是主－萬軍之耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["對舍伯那的警告"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["主－萬軍之耶和華這樣說：「你去見掌銀庫的，就是家宰舍伯那，對他說："]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["『你在這裏做甚麼呢？有甚麼人竟在這裏鑿墳墓，就是在高處為自己鑿墳墓，在磐石中為自己鑿出安身之所？"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["看哪，耶和華必像大有力的人，將你緊緊纏裹，竭力拋去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["他必將你滾成一團，拋在寬闊之地，好像拋球一樣。你這主人家的羞辱，必在那裏坐你榮耀的車，也必在那裏死亡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["我必趕逐你離開官職；你必從你的原位撤下。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["「到那日，我必召我僕人希勒家的兒子以利亞敬來，"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["將你的外袍給他穿上，將你的腰帶給他繫緊，將你的政權交在他手中。他必作耶路撒冷居民和猶大家的父。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["我必將大衛家的鑰匙放在他肩頭上。他開，無人能關；他關，無人能開。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["我必將他安穩，像釘子釘在堅固處；他必作為他父家榮耀的寶座。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["他父家所有的榮耀，連兒女帶子孫，都掛在他身上，好像一切小器皿，從杯子到酒瓶掛上一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["萬軍之耶和華說：當那日，釘在堅固處的釘子必壓斜，被砍斷落地；掛在其上的重擔必被剪斷。因為這是耶和華說的。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":17,"caller":"-","text":"原文是民女","reference":{"chapter":22,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/22.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/23.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/21.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}